## PhotoCraft (UI design system, menu catalog, toolbox grammar)

- Source: https://github.com/storytold/photocraft
- Licence: MIT — https://github.com/storytold/photocraft/blob/main/LICENSE
- Used here: the 8-theme token values (crates/ui-egui/src/theme.rs), the
  766-entry Photoshop menu catalog (crates/ui-egui/src/menu_catalog.rs),
  toolbar metrics/grouping (panels.rs), and the title-bar/dock layout grammar
  described in docs/ui-design.md. Files: `ui/theme.py`, `ui/menu_catalog.py`,
  `ui/toolbar.py`, `ui/titlebar.py`, `scripts/gen_menu_catalog.py`.
- PhotoCraft itself remains a separate Rust project; PixelForge is not
  affiliated with it. The PhotoCraft engine binary, when attached, is used
  unmodified for PSD verification.

